          "markdown": "## 3. Master Formula Table (Unit 1)\n\n| Law / Relation | Formula | SI Units |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Ohm's Law & DC Power | $V = IR$, $P = VI = I^2R = \\frac{V^2}{R}$ | $\\text{V}, \\text{A}, \\Omega, \\text{W}$ |\n| Inductor & Capacitor $v$–$i$ | $v_L = L\\frac{di}{dt}$ ($E_L = \\frac{1}{2}LI^2$), $i_C = C\\frac{dv}{dt}$ ($E_C = \\frac{1}{2}CV^2$) | $\\text{H}, \\text{F}, \\text{J}$ |\n| Series & Parallel Resistors | $R_{\\text{ser}} = \\sum R_k$, $\\frac{1}{R_{\\text{par}}} = \\sum \\frac{1}{R_k}$ ($R_{\\parallel} = \\frac{R_1 R_2}{R_1 + R_2}$) | $\\Omega$ |\n| Voltage Divider Rule | $V_k = V_{\\text{total}} \\cdot \\frac{R_k}{R_1 + R_2 + \\dots}$ | $\\text{V}$ |\n| Current Divider Rule (2 branches) | $I_1 = I_{\\text{total}} \\cdot \\frac{R_2}{R_1 + R_2}$, $I_2 = I_{\\text{total}} \\cdot \\frac{R_1}{R_1 + R_2}$ | $\\text{A}$ |\n| Source Transformation | $I_s = \\frac{V_s}{R_s} \\iff V_s = I_s R_s$ | $\\text{A}, \\text{V}$ |\n| Balanced Star $\\leftrightarrow$ Delta | $R_\\Delta = 3 R_Y$, $R_Y = \\frac{R_\\Delta}{3}$ | $\\Omega$ |\n| Thevenin / Max Power | $V_{\\text{th}} = V_{\\text{oc}}$, $R_{\\text{th}} = V_{\\text{oc}}/I_{\\text{sc}}$, $P_{\\max} = \\frac{V_{\\text{th}}^2}{4 R_{\\text{th}}}$ at $R_L = R_{\\text{th}}$ | $\\text{V}, \\Omega, \\text{W}$ |"
