          "title": "Master Formula Table (Unit 2)",
          "markdown": "## 3. Master Formula Table (Unit 2)\n\n| Quantity | Formula | SI Units |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Sinusoidal RMS & Avg | $V_{\\text{rms}} = \\frac{V_m}{\\sqrt{2}}$, $V_{\\text{avg}} = \\frac{2V_m}{\\pi}$ | $\\text{V}$ |\n| Form Factor & Peak Factor | $k_f = \\frac{V_{\\text{rms}}}{V_{\\text{avg}}} = 1.11$, $k_p = \\frac{V_m}{V_{\\text{rms}}} = 1.414$ | Dimensionless |\n| Inductive & Capacitive Reactance | $X_L = 2\\pi f L$, $X_C = \\frac{1}{2\\pi f C}$ | $\\Omega$ |\n| Series RLC Impedance & Current | $Z = R + j(X_L - X_C)$, $\\|Z\\| = \\sqrt{R^2 + (X_L - X_C)^2}$, $I = \\frac{V}{\\|Z\\|}$ | $\\Omega, \\text{A}$ |\n| Admittance | $Y = \\frac{1}{Z} = G + jB$ ($G = \\frac{R}{Z^2}, B = \\frac{-X}{Z^2}$) | $\\text{S}$ ($\\mho$) |\n| Power Triangle & PF | $P = VI\\cos\\phi$, $Q = VI\\sin\\phi$, $S = \\sqrt{P^2+Q^2} = VI$, $\\text{pf} = \\cos\\phi = \\frac{R}{Z} = \\frac{P}{S}$ | $\\text{W}, \\text{VAR}, \\text{VA}$ |\n| Star & Delta 3-Phase | Star: $V_L = \\sqrt{3}V_{\\text{ph}}, I_L = I_{\\text{ph}}$; Delta: $V_L = V_{\\text{ph}}, I_L = \\sqrt{3}I_{\\text{ph}}$ | $\\text{V}, \\text{A}$ |\n| 3-Phase Active / Reactive / Apparent | $P = \\sqrt{3}V_L I_L\\cos\\phi$, $Q = \\sqrt{3}V_L I_L\\sin\\phi$, $S = \\sqrt{3}V_L I_L$ | $\\text{W}, \\text{VAR}, \\text{VA}$ |\n| Series Resonance | $f_0 = \\frac{1}{2\\pi\\sqrt{LC}}$, $Q = \\frac{1}{R}\\sqrt{\\frac{L}{C}}$, $\\text{BW} = \\frac{f_0}{Q} = \\frac{R}{2\\pi L}$ | $\\text{Hz}, -, \\text{Hz}$ |"
