          "title": "Master Formula Table (Unit 3)",
          "markdown": "## 3. Master Formula Table (Unit 3)\n\n| Quantity | Formula | SI / Practical Units |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Faraday / Self / Mutual EMF | $e = -N\\frac{d\\Phi}{dt} = -L\\frac{di}{dt}$, $e_2 = -M\\frac{di_1}{dt}$ | $\\text{V}$, $L, M$ in $\\text{H}$ |\n| Mutual Inductance Coupling | $M = k\\sqrt{L_1 L_2}$ | $\\text{H}$ ($0 \\le k \\le 1$) |\n| Transformer EMF Equation | $E_1 = 4.44 f N_1 \\Phi_m$, $E_2 = 4.44 f N_2 \\Phi_m$ | $\\text{V}$ ($\\Phi_m$ in $\\text{Wb}$) |\n| Transformer Ratios | $\\frac{V_2}{V_1} = \\frac{N_2}{N_1} = \\frac{I_1}{I_2} = K$ | Dimensionless |\n| Equivalent Impedance Ref. Primary | $R_{01} = R_1 + R_2/K^2$, $X_{01} = X_1 + X_2/K^2$ | $\\Omega$ |\n| Transformer Efficiency & Max $\\eta$ | $\\eta = \\frac{xS\\cos\\phi}{xS\\cos\\phi + P_i + x^2P_{cu,\\text{fl}}}$, Max when $x^2 P_{cu,\\text{fl}} = P_i$ | $\\%, \\text{W}, \\text{VA}$ |\n| Approx. Voltage Regulation | $\\%\\text{Reg} = \\frac{I_1(R_{01}\\cos\\phi \\pm X_{01}\\sin\\phi)}{V_1}\\times 100\\%$ (`+` lag, `-` lead) | $\\%$ |\n| DC Machine EMF & Torque | $E = \\frac{\\Phi Z N P}{60 A}$, $T_a = 0.159\\,\\Phi Z I_a\\frac{P}{A}$ | $\\text{V}, \\text{N}\\cdot\\text{m}$ |\n| Induction Motor Speed & Slip | $N_s = \\frac{120 f}{P}$, $s = \\frac{N_s - N_r}{N_s}$, $f_r = s f$ | $\\text{RPM}, -, \\text{Hz}$ |"
